"Estimated concentrations and WPATH SOC-8 target ranges அரே references, not "
"measured values or medical advice; your இலக்குகள் சி-வைகாசி differ."

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "medical_disclaimer_preset_doses"
msgid ""
"Preset doses are reference values, not medical advice. Safe dosing depends "
"on lab results, other medications, medical history, and clinician "
"supervision."
msgstr ""
"Preset doses அரே குறிப்பு values, not medical advice. Safe dosing depends on"
" lab results, மற்றொன்று medications, medical history, and clinician "
"supervision."

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "medical_disclaimer_reference_ranges"
msgid ""
"Target ranges are general guidelines, not medical advice—your target ranges "
"may differ based on your treatment plan."
msgstr ""
"Target ranges அரே பொது guidelines, not medical advice—your target ranges "
"சி-வைகாசி differ based on your treatment plan."

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "medical_disclaimer_wpath_reference_ranges"
msgid ""
"Target ranges are based on WPATH Standards of Care 8. They are general "
"guidelines, not medical advice—your target ranges may differ based on your "
"treatment plan."
msgstr ""
"Target ranges அரே based on WPATH Standards of Care 8. They அரே பொது "
"guidelines, not medical advice—your target ranges சி-வைகாசி differ based on "
"your treatment plan."

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "medical_disclaimer_plasma_concentration_estimates"
msgid ""
